  "prefLabel": "Ncr 561.06 Outdoor Grills and Stoves",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 561.06 Outdoor Grills and Stoves. Charcoal fires in a container off the ground, gas or wood pellet devices such as grills and smokers, and all controlled camp stoves shall not require a fire permit.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5601.06), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
